":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"而且还是生的。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-e25\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nard00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-10c8\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-e25"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「其他的话，吃什么能够长寿呢……之前在电视看过一下，\n蛋白质什么的对身体很有好处吧？」","speaker":"老婆婆"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-efd\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nard00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-11a5\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-efd"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「婆婆，那个劝你还是别想的好」","speaker":"千里"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-f32\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nard00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-11f2\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-f32"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"我想象着老婆婆全身充满肌肉，\n胸部还抽动着的姿势","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-f88\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nard00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-127c\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-f88"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"太有冲击性了……这个画面。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-fca\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nard00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-12ba\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-fca"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"