wed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"我像往常一样漫步着。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-1e80\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nard00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-2461\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1e80"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"在途中有人向我问路。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-1eab\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nard00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-2494\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1eab"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"那并不是什么罕见的事情，以前也有过几次\n\n","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-1ef9\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nard00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-24e1\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1ef9"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"……但是，这次非常特殊","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-1f53\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nard00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-254f\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1f53"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「那么，也告诉你名字了，\n现在该告诉你到车站的路了呢」","speaker":"千里"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-1fc0\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nard00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-25b5\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1fc0"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","