:{"text":"被人问路这种事也有过几次，\n但是这次真是十分特别啊……","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-2248\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nard00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-28cb\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-2248"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"―――秋季。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-226b\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nard00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-28f2\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-226b"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"这是秋高气爽、硕果累累，适合读书运动的，太阳很快就下山的季节。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-22c0\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nard00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-296d\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-22c0"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"在这属于淡云的季节下，我依旧重复着没有半点改变的生活。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-230d\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nard00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-29da\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-230d"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"食欲并没有变旺，也没有蜕变成书虫，在艺术方面更没有取得什么瞩目的成就，\n依旧普普通通地过着日子。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-2393\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nard00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-2a53\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-2393"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"…但是。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-23b2\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nard00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-2a72\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-23b2"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"就算是这种日子，也不是『完全一样的日子』。\n反过来说，普普通通地过日子是不可能的吧！","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-242c\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nard00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-2b02\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-242c"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"…就是这样，特别是对于像我这样形形色色的『并不普通的人』来说。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-2492\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nard00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-2b5a\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-2492"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「这么说来…soldier是什么意思呢？」","speaker":"老婆婆"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-24fb\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nard00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-2bd8\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-24fb"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「老婆婆，请您不要用自己不懂的词汇啦…」","speaker":"千里"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-253a\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nard00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-2c21\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-253a"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"―――某个晴朗的日子。在那条熟悉的路上。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-2579\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nard00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-2c5a\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-2579"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"与偶然邂逅的老婆婆风牛马不相及的对话，\n以及一直在原地踏步没有进展的问路。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-25e9\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nard00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-2ccc\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-25e9"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"或许这可能是给我的日常生活带来改变的一个契机吧――","speaker":"旁白"}}]}
